@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:3000

### Deposit
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{"toAccount":"ACC-12345","amount":100.50,"currency":"USD","type":"deposit"}

### Transfer
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{"fromAccount":"ACC-12345","toAccount":"ACC-67890","amount":20.25,"currency":"USD","type":"transfer"}

### Withdrawal
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{"fromAccount":"ACC-67890","amount":5.25,"currency":"USD","type":"withdrawal"}

### List transactions
GET {{baseUrl}}/transactions

### Replace date range to include your demo date
GET {{baseUrl}}/transactions?accountId=ACC-12345&type=transfer&from=2026-01-01&to=2026-12-31

### Replace ID with one returned by POST
GET {{baseUrl}}/transactions/REPLACE_WITH_ID

### Currency-separated balances
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts/ACC-12345/balance

### Validation error
POST {{baseUrl}}/transactions
Content-Type: application/json

{"toAccount":"ACC-12345","amount":-1,"currency":"USD","type":"deposit"}
